{"name":"Flowerbed","hex":"#ffebda","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"flowerbed","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A part of a garden or park where flowers are grown."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/flowerbed"}],"entries":[{"title":"Flower garden","blocks":[{"text":"A flower garden or floral garden is any garden or part of a garden where plants that flower are grown and displayed. This normally refers mostly to herbaceous plants, rather than flowering woody plants, which dominate in the shrubbery and woodland garden, although both these types may be part of the planting in any area of the garden."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Flower_garden%2C_Botanic_Gardens%2C_Churchtown_2.JPG/330px-Flower_garden%2C_Botanic_Gardens%2C_Churchtown_2.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flower_garden"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Rosariet_arboretet.jpg/330px-Rosariet_arboretet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Rosariet_arboretet.jpg/330px-Rosariet_arboretet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Flower garden in Norway, Arboretum in Bergen","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARosariet_arboretet.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Flore_de_Bercy_16.jpg/500px-Flore_de_Bercy_16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Flore_de_Bercy_16.jpg/1280px-Flore_de_Bercy_16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Flore_de_Bercy_16.jpg/500px-Flore_de_Bercy_16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campa